WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Praise be to the Light! We've done it!

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.197
What is wrong with you? Why do I have to do everything myself? When will you finally restore energy supplies? Well? Cat got your tongue?

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The apparatus is lost? We can't go back to the Empire without it!

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Return the artifact at any price!
